      "writtenOn": "2026-10-01T23:53:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Calling it next is a good idea.\n\nNo statics was a rule to prevent agents from creatings statics. The two statics here occurred when the agent tried to overcomplicate the solution, and I replaced it with statics with my own judgement because it truly was the best solution here since we only care that the values are distinct, not what they are.",
